// Babylon station build (babylon-station.dmb): normal tg rounds on the map catalog's station
// maps (the supervisor writes data/next_map.json), with the Babylon cluster modules that every
// world shares. Babylon's drone-builder session and world rules stay in babylon.dme.
// Keep tgstation.dme identical to upstream.
// BABYLON_BUILDER (any Babylon cluster world) enables the upstream hooks every Babylon cluster world
// needs (admission, showcase visitors, persistence preloading ...); BABYLON_STATION marks this build.
// The hooks that only fit Babylon's drone builder test BABYLON_DRONE, which only babylon.dme
// defines (see modular_babylon/UPSTREAM_HOOKS.md).
// The full CentCom stays: station rounds need its shuttle docks (emergency, cargo, ferry).
#define BABYLON_BUILDER
#define BABYLON_STATION
#define ABSOLUTE_MINIMUM
#include "tgstation.dme"
#include "modular_babylon/__DEFINES/babylon.dm"
